Package: com.music27.tweak
Name: Music27
Version: 1.1.43
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Restyle Apple Music on iOS 16/17 toward the iOS 26/27 Liquid Glass look. 1.1.43: hides Music’s mini player with a layer mask instead of opacity, so it stays tappable and the pill can finally hand it the touch. Also slows the scroll-collapse so the dock stops snapping shut on every flick.
Maintainer: Music27
Author: Music27
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate (>= 0.9.5000), preferenceloader
